@title Command palette: icons, type chips, menu path chips and pinned tiles
@area Layout
# Lane V5 of the visual redesign (docs/design/visual-redesign.md section 7).
fresh
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 8
expect "PINNED"
shot empty
check_layout
text save
wait 8
expect "Command"
shot search-save
check_layout
key Escape
wait 6
